  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1408.3457v1</id>
    <title>New result and some open problems on the primitive degree of nonnegative tensors</title>
    <updated>2014-08-15T02:08:41Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1408.3457v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1408.3457v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>In this paper, we show that the exponent set of nonnegative primitive tensors with order m(\geq 3) and dimension n is {1,2,\ldots, (n-1)^2+1}; and propose some open problems for further research.</summary>
